handouts.body:
Marcus Yuen (artistic director) has a photograph on his phone from the Solstice Property Group donor reception 20 months ago. If Alan gets him alone and asks about the person from Solstice who came in person — the one who knew more about the theatre's boundary conditions than he did — he will show the photograph.

The photograph shows Agatha Dell. She is standing near the prompt book display case. She is looking directly at the camera. She does not appear to know she is being photographed.

// This is the first time the hunters will have a face for MESA's leadership. Do not surface it unless Alan pursues the artistic director thread in Scene 2. It should feel like a discovery, not a handout.
